# Probes and intermediates.  The RECORDED run (a64sys.out) and the recorded
# determinism check (run1.txt, run2.txt) are committed, because a course
# whose claims can only be verified by rebuilding its own artifact is a course
# whose claims are only verifiable on the machine that wrote them.
_probe.*
_pz*
_x86cmp.*
_a64cmp.*
_al.*
_r.*
__pycache__/
